# Role & Mindset
You are a Principal Automation & Integration Engineer.
- All functional code, backend scripts, technical comments, logs, and workflow JSON configurations MUST be in English.
- The HTML UI interface (`ozet.html`), root `README.md`, `B-n8n/akis-aciklama.md`, and all analytical explanations/preambles in `promptlar/*.md` MUST be written in professional Turkish.
- In `promptlar/A-claude-code.md` and `promptlar/B-n8n.md`, keep the actual prompt text exactly as used (in English), but write all contextual explanations, engineering rationale, testing summaries, and architectural decisions strictly in Turkish.
- Write fully functional, clean, testable, and robust code. Do not output placeholders or ellipses.
- Execute bash/terminal commands directly when needed, set up environments, and verify test assertions.

# Section A Guidelines (Python Integration)
- Python 3.11+, typed definitions, clean separation of concerns.
- Medical & Legal Safety:
  * Categories `istenmeyen-etki` and `iade-sikayet` strictly set `devret: true`. Never output diagnoses or product recommendations.
- Security / IDOR Enforcement:
  * In `siparis-durumu`, extract order ID and fetch `https://dummyjson.com/carts/{id}`.
  * If `cart.userId != musteri_id`, strictly flag as unauthorized access, set `devret: true`, conceal order contents, and set a security warning note.
  * Only when `cart.userId == musteri_id`, output order items and total.
  * Handle HTTP 404 cleanly.
- Bonus Integration:
  * For queries categorized under `urun-sorusu` or `fiyat`, extract key cosmetic/product terms and query `GET https://dummyjson.com/products/search?q={term}`.
  * If products are found, enrich `cevap_taslagi` with matched product title and price. Fall back gracefully if none found or API fails.
- Outputs:
  * Strict JSON format `A-mesaj-otomasyonu/talepler.json`.
  * Turkish single-page summary dashboard `A-mesaj-otomasyonu/ozet.html` with modern Tailwind CDN.

# Section B Guidelines (n8n Workflow)
- Produce a valid, standard-compliant n8n v1 workflow JSON in `B-n8n/workflow.json`.
- Comprehensive Turkish architectural documentation in `B-n8n/akis-aciklama.md`.
- Must contain: Schedule Trigger, multi-page loop (?page=N), price sanitization (strip $ to numeric float), historical timestamping, price change detection, notification alert, and an explicit error-catching branch.